OL,3,ABurnham 'really concerned' if Man City
OL,4,Aowners sell up after rule breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has said he would be
OL,7,F"really concerned" if Manchester City's
OL,8,Fowners decide to sell up after the club
OL,9,Fwas found guilty of Premier League
OL,10,Ffinancial rule breaches.
OL,12,FThe prime minister said the situation
OL,13,Fwas "contested by Manchester City" and
OL,14,Fhe praised the club's owners since 2008
OL,15,F- led by Sheikh Mansour, United Arab
OL,16,FEmirates deputy prime minister and
OL,17,Froyal family member - for investing in
OL,18,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
