OL,3,ABurnham 'really concerned' if Man City
OL,4,Aowners sell up after rule breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn independent commission found the
OL,7,Fclub guilty of the majority of the 115
OL,8,Fcharges they faced, a verdict that City
OL,9,Fare expected to appeal.
OL,11,FThe club continue to deny any
OL,12,Fwrongdoing and have until 2 October to
OL,13,Fsubmit an appeal.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
